WEBVTT

00:08.690 --> 00:16.160
aozameta machinami yureru boku no kage

00:08.690 --> 00:16.160
The pale street, my swaying shadow,

00:16.160 --> 00:24.440
nibui ashidori wa yuku saki wo shirazu

00:16.160 --> 00:24.440
I walk slowly, not knowing my destination.

00:24.440 --> 00:30.480
kawasenu omoi

00:24.440 --> 00:30.480
My feelings can't reach yours.

00:31.240 --> 00:38.620
kimi no hitomi no naka utsushidasu mono wo

00:31.240 --> 00:38.620
The things reflected in the depths of your eyes,

00:38.620 --> 00:46.860
uketomeru tame ni hashiridashiteita

00:38.620 --> 00:46.860
I started running in order to catch up to them.

00:46.860 --> 01:00.710
sashidasu sono te wo hodokerai youni nigirikaesu

00:46.860 --> 01:00.710
I grip your outstretched hand without letting go.

01:01.170 --> 01:08.750
hanbun no tsuki no yoru wa bokura wo terashite

01:01.170 --> 01:08.750
On this night, the half moon shines upon us.

01:08.750 --> 01:16.050
oikaketekita jikan wo boku wa furikitte

01:08.750 --> 01:16.050
I shake off the flow of time chasing after us.

01:16.220 --> 01:27.430
hanbun zutsu no bokura wa egaku saki made mo mieru

01:16.220 --> 01:27.430
We're half of ourselves, but we can draw the future.

01:43.010 --> 01:44.380
I'm begging you...

01:44.380 --> 01:46.080
Please save Yuuichi!

01:46.080 --> 01:47.550
That idiot!

01:48.590 --> 01:53.560
Inheritance of the Tada Collection

01:54.360 --> 01:57.560
You're already like this and you're still running around.

01:58.060 --> 01:59.500
Because he's an idiot.

02:00.300 --> 02:02.370
It seems you'll be spending your New Year in the hospital...

02:02.370 --> 02:03.700
What a pity...

02:03.700 --> 02:05.740
You could've been out of the hospital very soon too.

02:05.740 --> 02:07.370
Because he's an idiot.

02:08.140 --> 02:10.110
During this time, you have to rest.

02:10.110 --> 02:12.630
Well... I don't think you'll have the energy to move anyway...

02:14.650 --> 02:16.150
Did you hear that, idiot?

02:16.150 --> 02:18.050
If you run off again, I'll kill you!

02:29.290 --> 02:32.820
When the girl you like appears...

02:34.300 --> 02:35.750
Exclaim your feelings clearly!

02:36.230 --> 02:39.600
Don't give up or you will regret it for the rest of your life.

02:40.340 --> 02:44.700
Especially if you give up without saying a word.

02:45.340 --> 02:48.110
Did Tada-san say it in the end?

02:48.810 --> 02:50.350
Me?

02:50.350 --> 02:52.480
I am an idiot!

02:52.480 --> 02:56.210
Because I've been an idiot, I've been regretting it ever since.

02:57.360 --> 03:00.630
Regrets are a painful thing to live by...

03:08.130 --> 03:09.050
Tada-san...

03:11.170 --> 03:14.770
Has everyone planned how they want to spend their Christmas Eve yet?

03:15.110 --> 03:19.280
I'll be suggesting a few wonderful locations for those who haven't.

03:40.100 --> 03:41.130
Idiot!

03:42.570 --> 03:44.100
Umm, so...

03:44.670 --> 03:46.740
Why did it turn out like this?

03:46.740 --> 03:48.370
Because you're a patient.

03:49.510 --> 03:50.910
Aren't you one too?

03:50.910 --> 03:52.240
Your condition is even worse.

03:52.240 --> 03:55.370
Yuuichi, you can't get up yet.

03:55.680 --> 03:58.120
It's okay if I sit up for a bit.

03:58.120 --> 03:59.380
No.

03:59.380 --> 04:00.720
But...

04:00.720 --> 04:01.770
No!

04:02.190 --> 04:03.120
Umm...

04:03.120 --> 04:04.120
No!

04:15.700 --> 04:17.000
Umm...

04:17.000 --> 04:17.990
I...

04:18.570 --> 04:20.370
It wasn't because of my father...

04:20.370 --> 04:23.610
that I brought you to Mt. Houdai.

04:23.940 --> 04:24.910
Eh?

04:24.910 --> 04:28.050
Could it be that you came all the way over here just to tell me that?

04:28.050 --> 04:29.700
Y-Yeah, that's right...

04:30.110 --> 04:32.120
Do you not remember?

04:32.120 --> 04:33.040
Eh?

04:34.690 --> 04:35.620
About...

04:35.620 --> 04:36.690
Err...

04:36.690 --> 04:39.040
You fainting on Mt. Houdai...

04:39.920 --> 04:40.790
Ah...

04:40.790 --> 04:41.850
So...

04:42.530 --> 04:43.330
Umm...

04:44.730 --> 04:46.120
You said something...

04:46.760 --> 04:47.800
I...

04:47.800 --> 04:49.130
said something?

04:49.870 --> 04:50.750
Yeah...

04:52.240 --> 04:53.600
You did...

04:59.580 --> 05:00.580
I...

05:00.580 --> 05:02.510
What did I say to you?

05:02.510 --> 05:04.450
Yuuichi!

05:04.820 --> 05:07.120
I told you not to run around anymore.

05:07.120 --> 05:08.990
Why can't you understand?

05:08.990 --> 05:10.660
Your head must be empty inside.

05:10.660 --> 05:12.060
Yeah... It's got to be like that...

05:12.060 --> 05:13.490
Like soft green pepper...

05:13.490 --> 05:16.290
Hit it slightly and it'll make a pong sound.

05:20.330 --> 05:21.250
Just...

05:21.870 --> 05:23.490
What did I say?

05:47.830 --> 05:49.730
That is the power of youth.

05:52.330 --> 05:53.930
Hey, Yuuichi.

05:54.330 --> 05:55.000
Huh?

05:55.700 --> 05:57.600
You sure have a tough life.

05:58.300 --> 05:59.840
What is it this time?

05:59.840 --> 06:00.910
Bread?

06:00.910 --> 06:02.540
Or maybe a drink?

06:03.370 --> 06:06.180
You didn't come to take care of me in the first place.

06:07.950 --> 06:09.380
Because...

06:09.380 --> 06:11.650
Even I don't know how much longer I have to live.

06:12.520 --> 06:14.220
To tell you the truth,

06:14.220 --> 06:18.060
nothing good will happen, even if you take care of me.

06:20.220 --> 06:22.060
Even so, I don't mind.

06:26.660 --> 06:27.730
I...

06:28.500 --> 06:30.640
might be having an operation.

06:31.840 --> 06:33.170
Is it okay?

06:33.540 --> 06:35.370
Isn't it dangerous?

06:35.870 --> 06:37.340
If I don't go through with it,

06:37.340 --> 06:39.910
the time I have left will only recede each day.

06:40.910 --> 06:42.010
If I go through with the operation,

06:42.010 --> 06:44.280
there might still be a chance to recover.

06:47.720 --> 06:48.820
Like this...

06:49.290 --> 06:50.460
I am ready.

06:53.660 --> 06:55.460
Thanks to you.

07:07.370 --> 07:08.540
Yuuichi!

07:08.540 --> 07:11.510
Don't even think about sneaking off, even if you feel better!

07:11.510 --> 07:14.080
I'll use the bench to lock you in again.

07:14.080 --> 07:15.250
Got it.

07:24.290 --> 07:28.160
Weather Report

07:24.720 --> 07:28.160
Expect to see some flurries within most of the area around sunset.

07:33.130 --> 07:35.170
Yo! How are you feeling, Ezaki?

07:35.170 --> 07:37.400
What's this, Yamanishi?

07:37.400 --> 07:39.000
Honestly, you're still like this...

07:39.000 --> 07:41.610
Despite my rare visits.

07:41.610 --> 07:44.280
Your goal is definitely those anyway...

07:44.280 --> 07:46.440
As long as you know.

07:46.840 --> 07:48.010
Incredible!

07:48.010 --> 07:49.450
As good as I expected,

07:49.450 --> 07:50.920
Ezaki's Collection!

07:50.920 --> 07:52.950
How many of them are there?

07:52.950 --> 07:54.890
It's Tada's collection.

07:54.890 --> 07:56.850
I'm not the one who collected it.

07:56.850 --> 07:59.920
But you inherited it, right?

07:59.920 --> 08:01.290
Awesome!

08:01.290 --> 08:03.030
Ezaki, you want to take a look too?

08:03.030 --> 08:04.760
Y-Yeah.

08:06.360 --> 08:08.230
Wow!

08:11.900 --> 08:13.140
Unbelievable!

08:13.140 --> 08:14.370
Isn't it?

08:14.370 --> 08:15.540
What are you guys doing?

08:17.540 --> 08:20.040
Ezaki! Lend me a few...

08:27.450 --> 08:29.450
There's so many of them.

08:30.990 --> 08:33.960
You sure are an interesting person.

08:36.290 --> 08:38.060
I see.

08:39.930 --> 08:40.730
Who is she?

08:42.130 --> 08:43.200
Your girlfriend?

08:44.770 --> 08:45.740
You can't help it...

08:45.740 --> 08:46.700
Might as well give up now.

08:55.680 --> 08:56.710
Who is it?

08:57.380 --> 08:58.950
M-Me...

09:01.150 --> 09:02.820
Rika, can I come in?

09:04.190 --> 09:05.190
Umm, so...

09:05.790 --> 09:07.230
Let me explain...

09:08.090 --> 09:08.990
Ouch...

09:15.730 --> 09:16.700
Blood...

09:17.000 --> 09:18.270
I've already bled this much...

09:18.270 --> 09:19.640
Don't come here anymore!

09:20.670 --> 09:21.570
Idiot!

09:25.110 --> 09:25.980
Rika...

09:29.980 --> 09:31.550
So cold...

09:32.620 --> 09:34.220
Ambush attack...

09:34.220 --> 09:35.550
So cold...

09:39.660 --> 09:40.390
She's coming!

09:42.830 --> 09:43.830
Rika! Sorry!

09:43.830 --> 09:44.600
It's my fault!

09:44.600 --> 09:45.230
I apologize!

09:45.230 --> 09:45.800
Please forgive me!

09:45.800 --> 09:46.600
I'll do anything!

09:46.600 --> 09:49.530
I'll borrow books from the library for you every single day!

09:49.530 --> 09:50.100
I'm begging you!

09:50.100 --> 09:51.370
Forgive me!

09:56.210 --> 09:57.240
Rika?

10:03.850 --> 10:04.950
Huh?

10:08.090 --> 10:09.720
The door is locked!

10:10.820 --> 10:12.420
No way!

10:14.760 --> 10:18.200
Note: Wakaba Municipal Hospital

10:28.570 --> 10:30.070
Help me...

10:32.680 --> 10:34.350
It's probably a cold.

10:34.350 --> 10:36.280
Let's get Ichiou-sensei to look at you.

10:36.280 --> 10:38.780
It'll be bad if the Hepatitis got worse.

10:38.780 --> 10:39.820
Understood.

10:39.820 --> 10:42.290
Why were you up there?

10:42.990 --> 10:44.820
I was locked out...

10:45.620 --> 10:46.560
By whom?

10:47.590 --> 10:48.660
Rika...

10:49.490 --> 10:50.930
She discovered them...

10:51.230 --> 10:52.300
Discovered what?

10:57.370 --> 10:59.070
She found those?

11:01.610 --> 11:04.340
My stomach aches...

11:04.340 --> 11:07.350
You don't have to laugh like that...

11:08.280 --> 11:10.650
I almost lost my life...

11:10.650 --> 11:13.050
Die then, it's better to die now anyway...

11:15.350 --> 11:17.190
This would probably cause serious damage.

11:17.190 --> 11:18.960
Serious damage?

11:19.620 --> 11:21.760
I heard it was only a cold.

11:21.760 --> 11:24.530
Natsume-sensei, you're back?

11:24.530 --> 11:25.430
Yeah...

11:25.430 --> 11:28.400
My vacation just ended and they wanted me to come back already.

11:28.400 --> 11:30.540
This hospital sure knows how to get people to work.

11:32.240 --> 11:33.570
Does your throat hurt?

11:33.940 --> 11:35.010
It hurts.

11:35.610 --> 11:37.010
Although it's cold outside...

11:37.010 --> 11:39.140
Did you go up there to do some carefree stargazing?

11:39.580 --> 11:40.350
Yeah...

11:40.350 --> 11:41.710
Something like that...

11:46.920 --> 11:47.890
Rika...

11:51.160 --> 11:52.060
Hey...

11:53.520 --> 11:54.560
What are you doing?

11:54.560 --> 11:55.890
Uh, yeah...

11:56.290 --> 11:57.900
I was sun bathing...

11:58.500 --> 12:00.670
Go back before the weather changes...

12:00.670 --> 12:02.630
You still have that cold right?

12:03.900 --> 12:05.040
Yes...

12:05.770 --> 12:07.510
You don't recognize me anymore?

12:07.970 --> 12:09.770
It's Natsume, Natsume.

12:10.510 --> 12:12.040
Natsume-sensei?

12:12.410 --> 12:13.310
Where's your beard?

12:13.910 --> 12:16.210
Staying up in the mountains for 2 months is hard on a person.

12:16.650 --> 12:21.150
The second I came down, they told me to take my shift.

12:21.150 --> 12:23.490
My appearance scared a kid from E.R. to tears...

12:23.820 --> 12:25.660
So I decided to shave it off and feel a lot more refreshed now.

12:25.660 --> 12:26.760
Ah...

12:26.760 --> 12:29.390
It seems like Rika hates you.

12:30.630 --> 12:31.800
How'd you know?

12:33.130 --> 12:35.230
Rika told me all about it...

12:35.700 --> 12:37.570
She's really angry.

12:38.640 --> 12:40.870
She's scary when she's angry, isn't she?

12:41.440 --> 12:43.310
Very scary...

12:44.740 --> 12:46.210
Do you know Rika?

12:46.940 --> 12:48.950
Of course I do.

12:48.950 --> 12:50.350
I'm her chief physician.

12:50.780 --> 12:51.920
Chief physician...

12:52.380 --> 12:53.720
Then her heart...

12:54.350 --> 12:56.050
About her condition...

12:56.050 --> 12:57.920
Who told you about it?

12:57.920 --> 12:58.860
Rika told me.

13:00.390 --> 13:02.160
How rare...

13:02.160 --> 13:03.830
She actually told someone about it...

13:04.400 --> 13:05.830
Is it?

13:06.260 --> 13:08.670
I've known Rika for years now.

13:09.200 --> 13:12.240
For her to tell others about her condition...

13:12.770 --> 13:15.970
This is probably a first.

13:16.270 --> 13:17.580
I see...

13:18.040 --> 13:19.880
Her personality is like that...

13:19.880 --> 13:22.750
She doesn't have many friends...

13:22.750 --> 13:24.580
She doesn't want to make any friends anyway.

13:25.250 --> 13:29.250
So, to have someone who she can talk about her condition to...

13:29.250 --> 13:31.090
For Rika, it's a good thing too.

13:33.320 --> 13:34.130
Ezaki,

13:34.690 --> 13:37.000
be nice to Rika in the future too.

13:37.760 --> 13:39.130
As her friend...

13:40.500 --> 13:41.470
Friend?

13:42.100 --> 13:44.070
Friends are very important.

13:44.070 --> 13:46.340
She can talk about a lot of things to a friend.

13:47.070 --> 13:48.970
Of course, unlike lovers,

13:48.970 --> 13:52.040
there's a boundary that shouldn't be crossed by friends...

13:52.040 --> 13:53.650
But that's something that can't be helped.

13:54.780 --> 13:57.980
There are people who say that a man and a woman can never build a friendship together.

13:57.980 --> 13:59.080
But that's a lie.

13:59.820 --> 14:01.490
Because aren't you and Rika...

14:01.490 --> 14:02.990
friends?

14:05.860 --> 14:07.690
Please take care of Rika...

14:07.690 --> 14:08.830
Friend.

14:39.960 --> 14:41.960
Eh? Interesting!

14:41.960 --> 14:42.990
Studying?

14:43.430 --> 14:45.800
Smoking is not healthy for you.

14:45.800 --> 14:47.500
Did you just say something?

14:48.030 --> 14:50.600
Ow! Ow! Ow!

14:51.470 --> 14:53.810
What do you think you're doing to your patient?

14:55.910 --> 14:58.810
Are you still fighting with Rika?

15:00.880 --> 15:02.980
Rika is too stubborn...

15:02.980 --> 15:08.420
It's normal for brats like you to hide one or two of those adult books.

15:08.420 --> 15:11.060
But it's not just one or two...

15:12.390 --> 15:14.560
That kid is a bit confused too...

15:16.330 --> 15:19.830
Even though she rarely shows her emotions and her feelings are unpredictable...

15:19.830 --> 15:22.100
You can tell she's down.

15:22.600 --> 15:24.540
Not showing her emotions...

15:24.840 --> 15:26.300
Are you talking about Rika?

15:26.670 --> 15:27.270
Yeah.

15:28.610 --> 15:32.110
Rika always laughs and gets angry around me...

15:32.510 --> 15:33.810
Eh?

15:33.810 --> 15:35.110
Is that right?

15:36.180 --> 15:37.950
It's almost time.

15:38.580 --> 15:41.190
Yuuichi, Rika will be here soon.

15:41.190 --> 15:42.090
Eh?

15:42.520 --> 15:46.460
I called her here. Make sure you have a nice talk with her.

15:46.460 --> 15:47.430
But...

15:47.430 --> 15:50.360
Even if you have to beg on your knees, give her a nice apology.

15:50.360 --> 15:52.600
Rika wants to make up as well...

15:53.060 --> 15:56.970
Giving people a chance to forgive you is also a man's duty.

15:57.370 --> 16:00.470
You'd better remember my kindness for the rest of your life.

16:13.920 --> 16:15.290
Sorry, Rika.

16:15.890 --> 16:17.220
What are you doing?

16:19.690 --> 16:21.330
Nothing really...

16:21.330 --> 16:21.890
Oh right!

16:21.890 --> 16:23.630
I got some good stuff for you!

16:25.160 --> 16:27.570
Imported from another country!

16:27.830 --> 16:28.970
No way...

16:28.970 --> 16:30.030
I don't...

16:30.030 --> 16:33.170
Children should accept an adult's kindness.

16:33.170 --> 16:34.040
Later.

16:50.520 --> 16:51.290
Rika!

16:51.290 --> 16:51.860
It's not like that!

16:51.860 --> 16:52.920
Let me explain!

16:55.460 --> 16:56.490
No way...

17:17.380 --> 17:18.380
Idiot.

17:38.100 --> 17:39.600
So cold...

17:57.420 --> 18:01.990
I said I'd quit smoking, but why do I still carry a lighter?

18:06.300 --> 18:09.670
Smoking is not good for your health.

18:10.400 --> 18:12.100
Hey, Tanizaki...

18:12.100 --> 18:14.910
Could it be that you don't like me?

18:14.910 --> 18:16.610
Yeah, that's right.

18:17.040 --> 18:18.610
Why?

18:18.610 --> 18:19.410
First,

18:19.410 --> 18:22.410
for asking people this kind of question so directly.

18:22.410 --> 18:23.410
Huh?

18:23.410 --> 18:24.420
And,

18:24.420 --> 18:28.020
that smirk of yours while we're discussing this.

18:28.790 --> 18:30.050
I see.

18:30.420 --> 18:34.130
The most hateful thing is watching you play Yuuichi around like a fool.

18:34.130 --> 18:37.360
Yuuichi and Rika are both really miserable now.

18:37.700 --> 18:38.860
I see.

18:38.860 --> 18:41.900
Why do you need to do such a cruel thing?

18:41.900 --> 18:42.900
It's nothing.

18:43.230 --> 18:45.870
You're the chief physician! You should understand!

18:45.870 --> 18:49.140
Those two don't have much time to be with each other.

18:49.140 --> 18:52.080
And yet, you have to steal their already limited time...

18:52.710 --> 18:54.080
That's right.

18:54.080 --> 18:56.350
Why do you need to do such a cruel thing?

18:57.380 --> 18:59.080
Because it's fun.

19:03.120 --> 19:04.720
You bastard.

19:05.660 --> 19:07.460
Hey, Tanizaki...

19:08.860 --> 19:12.060
I'll go talk to Rika.

19:13.730 --> 19:16.070
What are you planning now?

19:17.870 --> 19:19.670
I think it'll be interesting.

19:31.080 --> 19:32.180
Rika...

19:32.920 --> 19:34.320
I want to see you.

19:37.660 --> 19:38.620
Rika!

19:38.620 --> 19:40.930
Uh, umm...

19:41.930 --> 19:43.260
The weather's nice, isn't it?

19:43.660 --> 19:45.730
Y-Yeah, it is...

19:46.360 --> 19:47.670
It's pretty warm.

19:48.270 --> 19:50.130
Y-Yeah, it is...

19:52.270 --> 19:54.370
The wind feels comfortable too.

19:54.370 --> 19:55.710
Y-Yeah.

19:56.710 --> 19:57.940
Yuuichi is the person...

19:58.710 --> 19:59.880
I hate the most.

20:01.380 --> 20:04.880
Stupid, noisy and perverted.

20:05.850 --> 20:06.990
I hate you the most.

20:07.750 --> 20:08.720
Sorry...

20:09.550 --> 20:12.220
This isn't something that can be forgiven with a sorry.

20:13.020 --> 20:14.560
Even if it's like that...

20:14.560 --> 20:15.360
Sorry...

20:16.430 --> 20:17.160
Yeah.

20:22.270 --> 20:24.470
I won't make you sad anymore!

20:25.640 --> 20:27.710
Of course you won't.

20:28.510 --> 20:29.910
That's right...

20:29.910 --> 20:31.380
Of course I won't...

20:32.480 --> 20:34.950
I hate you the most.

20:40.650 --> 20:43.190
Ah! Look, it's a plane!

20:43.590 --> 20:44.820
It is!

20:45.420 --> 20:46.760
I wonder where it's going.

20:47.990 --> 20:49.590
It'd be great if it's to another country.

20:49.960 --> 20:51.260
How strange...

20:51.260 --> 20:53.770
You're not a passenger on it.

20:54.900 --> 20:57.900
Flying far away sounds pretty good.

20:58.970 --> 21:00.540
Far away?

21:05.110 --> 21:05.910
What is it?

21:06.940 --> 21:08.210
I feel a bit...

21:09.210 --> 21:11.950
You're thinking of something perverted again, right?

21:11.950 --> 21:13.690
Why do you say that?

21:13.690 --> 21:15.020
Hmph.

21:16.620 --> 21:17.760
Hey, Rika...

21:17.760 --> 21:18.620
Huh?

21:19.460 --> 21:21.660
What made you forgive me?

21:22.390 --> 21:24.900
Natsume-sensei told me...

21:25.300 --> 21:26.300
Huh?

21:26.300 --> 21:28.370
Natsume-sensei told me...

21:28.370 --> 21:30.340
He told me to forgive you.

21:31.900 --> 21:35.470
He was taking care of me when I was in my last hospital.

21:35.910 --> 21:38.980
So when he transferred to this hospital,

21:38.980 --> 21:41.110
I transferred too.

21:43.280 --> 21:45.120
You were following Natsume...

21:45.620 --> 21:47.220
Yeah, that's right.

21:47.920 --> 21:49.320
So you only talked to me because...

21:49.320 --> 21:51.620
He told you to talk to me?

21:51.620 --> 21:52.560
That's right...

21:53.120 --> 21:56.530
Otherwise I'd never ever forgive you!

21:57.700 --> 21:58.730
Why?

22:11.580 --> 22:13.140
A guy like him!

22:22.990 --> 22:24.520
Papa's book...

22:38.800 --> 22:48.280
nee, yubisaki de anata wo kanjite

22:38.800 --> 22:48.280
Hey, I felt you with my fingers.

22:50.880 --> 23:00.430
nee, anata to miteita kono keshiki

22:50.880 --> 23:00.430
Hey, while seeing this view together.

23:03.930 --> 23:13.740
tsutawaru yasashisa ni mi wo yudanete

23:03.930 --> 23:13.740
And then I committed myself to your kindness.

23:13.740 --> 23:25.080
eien nado nai wakatte ita tsumori dayo

23:13.740 --> 23:25.080
I know nothing lasts forever.

23:28.290 --> 23:34.260
namae wo yobu anata no koe wo

23:28.290 --> 23:40.230
I will keep your voice, which calls my name, in the bottom of my heart,

23:34.260 --> 23:40.230
mune no oku ni shimatte oku kara

23:40.230 --> 23:46.340
hirakareta tobira no mukou gawa de

23:40.230 --> 23:46.340
On the other side of the open door,

23:46.340 --> 23:53.540
koborenu youni kienai youni

23:46.340 --> 23:53.540
That it won't overflow, it won't disappear.

